<title>USA: Information Storage names Ochiltree pres.</title>
<headline>Information Storage names Ochiltree pres.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information Storage Devices Inc said Jock Ochiltree was named president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>As president, he assumes duties previously held by David Angel, the company's chief executive officer who will also assume the additional title of chairman.</p>
<p>Ochiltree joins the company from Exar Corp, where he was vice president of the company's products group.</p>
